  "content": "\n\n<h1>拴繩實體瞬回</h1>\n<p><strong>當拴著的實體落後過遠時，會自動將其瞬間拉回身邊。</strong></p>\n<p>可在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsnap-leashed-entities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snap-leashed-entities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> 下載。</p>\n<h2>💡 範例</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fvictorfaurschou%252fsnap-leashed-entities%252f26.1%252f.github%252fexamples%252f1.gif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/victorfaurschou/snap-leashed-entities/26.1/.github/examples/1.gif\" alt=\"1\"></a></p>\n<h2>📌 注意事項</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>拴繩在技術上並非完全無法破壞，但在實際遊戲中，幾乎在所有情況下都會變得無可摧毀。</li>\n<li>僅處理直接拴在玩家身上的實體。拴在非玩家錨點（例如一艘船拴在另一艘船上）的實體則不適用此功能。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🔗 相依項目</h2>\n<h3>必要</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Loader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🏷️ 標籤</h2>\n<p><code>minecraft, mod, fabric, 拴繩, 拴繩, 牽引繩, 牽引繩, 瞬回, 傳送, 跟隨, 生活品質, qol</code></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
